  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Görülen anahtarları bir kümede tut.",
      "en": "Keep the keys seen in a set."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`sort_keys=True` anahtar sırasını eşitler.",
      "en": "`sort_keys=True` makes the key order equal."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport json\n\n\ndef mark_repeats(calls):\n    seen, marks = set(), []\n    for call in calls:\n        key = json.dumps(call, sort_keys=True)\n        marks.append(\"repeat\" if key in seen else \"run\")\n        seen.add(key)\n    return marks\n\n\nA = {\"name\": \"get_order\", \"arguments\": {\"order_id\": \"ORD-1\"}}\nB = {\"arguments\": {\"order_id\": \"ORD-1\"}, \"name\": \"get_order\"}\nC = {\"name\": \"get_order\", \"arguments\": {\"order_id\": \"ORD-2\"}}\nprint(mark_repeats([A, C, B, C]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport json\n\n\ndef mark_repeats(calls):\n    seen, marks = set(), []\n    for call in calls:\n        key = json.dumps(call, sort_keys=True)\n        marks.append(\"repeat\" if key in seen else \"run\")\n        seen.add(key)\n    return marks\n\n\nA = {\"name\": \"get_order\", \"arguments\": {\"order_id\": \"ORD-1\"}}\nB = {\"arguments\": {\"order_id\": \"ORD-1\"}, \"name\": \"get_order\"}\nC = {\"name\": \"get_order\", \"arguments\": {\"order_id\": \"ORD-2\"}}\nprint(mark_repeats([A, C, B, C]))\n```"
    }
  ],
